  "markdown": "# The Legend of “Add cursor pagination to GET /users”\n\n*A party of eight · 1m 07s · 136k tokens · $0.217*\n\nThe Guildmaster took up the quest “Add cursor pagination to GET /users”, and sent seven adventurers out to see it done.\n\n## I. The Guildmaster at the Quest Board\n\n*0:00–1:07 (1m 07s) · 2.0k tokens · $0.003*\n\n- **Deeds:** 1 plan\n\n## II. The Scout — “Map how GET /users flows from route to query”\n\n*Sent by the Guildmaster · 0:04–0:11 (7s) · 12.3k tokens · $0.020*\n\n- **Deeds:** 2 reads, 2 searches\n- **Loot:** routes.ts → service.ts → queries.ts; findUsers returns every row.\n\n## III. The Architect — “Design the pagination contract”\n\n*Sent by the Guildmaster · 0:11–0:22 (11s) · 15.0k tokens · $0.024*\n\n- **Deeds:** 1 edit, 1 consultation\n- **Loot:** Contract: ?cursor&limit → { items, nextCursor }. Two tasks: API, query.\n\n## IV. The Artisan II — “API: parse cursor + limit, return nextCursor”\n\n*Sent by the Guildmaster · 0:23–0:35 (12s) · 28.3k tokens · $0.045*\n\n- **Deeds:** 2 edits, 1 command, 1 read\n- **Loot:** Route takes cursor & limit, encodes nextCursor.\n\n## V. The Artisan — “Query: keyset pagination on (created\\_at, id)”\n\n*Sent by the Guildmaster · 0:23–0:40 (18s)*\n\n- **Deeds:** 2 edits, 1 command, 1 read\n- **Plea** (0:30): Asked for your word; it was given after 7s.\n- **Loot:** findUsers(cursor, limit) with an index on (created\\_at, id).\n\n## VI. The Archivist — “Check the ORM's keyset API”\n\n*Sent by the Guildmaster · 0:23–0:28 (5s) · 10.5k tokens · $0.017*\n\n- **Deeds:** 1 consultation\n- **Loot:** Use a row-value comparison: (created\\_at, id) &gt; ($1, $2).\n\n## VII. The Warden — “Verify against the contract”\n\n*Sent by the Guildmaster · 0:41–0:51 (11s) · 15.3k tokens · $0.024*\n\n- **Deeds:** 1 test run, 1 read\n- **Failure** (0:47): Tests failed: \\`bun test users\\`, 1 failing.\n- **Loot:** FAIL: nextCursor skips the final row on exact page boundaries.\n\n## VIII. The Artisan — “Fix: fetch limit + 1 to detect the next page”\n\n*Called back by the Guildmaster · 0:52–0:59 (7s) · 39.5k tokens · $0.063 for both quests*\n\n- **Deeds:** 1 edit, 1 test run\n- **Loot:** Lookahead row added; boundary test passes.\n\n## IX. The Warden II — “Re-verify”\n\n*Sent by the Guildmaster · 0:59–1:05 (6s) · 12.8k tokens · $0.020*\n\n- **Deeds:** 1 test run\n- **Loot:** PASS: contract holds, boundaries covered.\n\n---\n\n> GET /users now pages by cursor: ?cursor&limit → { items, nextCursor }. All 214 tests pass.\n\n*The quest was done in 1m 07s, though not without cost: one trial failed.*\n",
